dnsdb2-python (1.2.1-1) debian-fsi; urgency=medium

  * Preserve the HTTP response body in QueryError when the server returns an
    error status not already mapped to a specific exception (e.g. 400, 404,
    500), instead of discarding it as an empty exception message.
  * Preserve the underlying error message when a connection-level failure
    (timeout, DNS error, etc.) is converted to a QueryError.

